5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I am Daisuke. I feel a bit nervous, but I will try to listen carefully to everyone.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,Shion here. I prefer logic over emotion. Let us observe who speaks first and who hesitates.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,Shunichi. I am calm. Panic is for amateurs. Let's see who blinks first.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hi, I'm Midori. I love cooking, so I like to keep things warm and harmonious. Let's be nice.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,George,,"George. I have seen many games. Trust your gut, but verify with facts. Stay calm.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,"Shion's logic sounds good. I worry about making mistakes, so I will follow the group's lead.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Daisuke, your hesitation is noted. It is a data point. I will analyze the flow of conversation.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Daisuke, stop apologizing. It makes you look guilty. Shion, your analysis is boring but useful.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"Shunichi, please be gentle. Daisuke is just shy. We should all support each other to find the truth.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,George,,"Midori is right. Kindness builds trust. Shunichi, your aggression is suspicious. Keep that in mind.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Midori"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I am sorry, Shunichi. I will try to be more confident. George, thank you for the advice.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Confidence is a mask. I see through it. Daisuke, your apology was too quick. Why?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Because I am polite, Shion. Not because I am guilty. You are overthinking everything.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,Let's not jump to conclusions. We are all new here. Let's focus on finding the werewolf together.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,George,,Agreed. We need to establish a baseline. Who feels most comfortable speaking freely?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,I think Midori seems the most comfortable. I will try to speak more clearly from now on.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shion,,Midori's comfort is suspicious. Innocents often hide behind kindness. I will watch her closely.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"Shion, you are paranoid. Midori is just friendly. I am the one you should be watching.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,"I am just trying to help. I hope we can all work together peacefully. Goodnight, everyone.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,George,,"Goodnight. I will observe the dynamics. Trust the process, not just the words.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
