38,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"George, if you are the Seer, why didn't you check me? I am the most suspicious, aren't I?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Midori,,"George, thank you for sharing. I hope this helps us find the werewolf quickly and peacefully.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,George,,"I checked Shion first. Her logic was the most structured. Now, Shunichi, your reaction is interesting.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
